---
title: Identity and access · authenticate, then authorize
---
flowchart TB
  staff([Owner or admin]):::people
  participant([Originating user]):::people
  auth["`**Supabase Auth**
  Verified auth subject
  No client scope from metadata`"]:::external
  staff -->|sign in| auth
  participant -->|Discord sign-in| auth

  subgraph staff_access [Client staff access]
    direction TB
    members[("`**Staff membership**
    client_id + client_member_id
    One owner; zero or more admins`")]:::outcome
    dashboard["`**Dashboard authority**
    Read-only member list
    Authorized client records
    Audited case stop`"]:::people
    members -->|membership| dashboard
  end

  revoke[/Offboarding or revocation/]:::external

  subgraph participant_access [Customer participant access]
    direction TB
    claim{{"`**Invitation claim**
    Discord user must match
    Client + signal + expiry`"}}:::gate
    session["`**Session authority**
    Same originating user
    Preview and extension binding`"]:::observation
    claim -->|claim| session
  end

  auth -->|verified identity| members
  auth ~~~ revoke
  auth -->|verified identity| claim
  revoke blocked_1@-.->|narrows| staff_access
  revoke blocked_2@-.->|narrows| participant_access
